# 统一换行符策略，避免不同系统协作时出现整文件 diff

# 默认：由 Git 自动识别文本文件，仓库内统一存 LF
* text=auto

# Windows 专用脚本必须是 CRLF，否则可能执行异常
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件不做换行转换，也不参与 diff
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.xlsx binary
*.db binary
*.zip binary
*.docx binary
*.pdf binary
